9","cityId":"33204","category":"地理・自然","text":"玉野市には金甲山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%8E%89%E9%87%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111401356"},{"id":"33204:national:6f1ee6a8fac6","cityId":"33204","category":"地理・自然","text":"玉野市には貝殻山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%8E%89%E9%87%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111401356"},{"id":"33204:national:5b9ae572e3db","cityId":"33204","category":"地域","text":"玉野市は、岡山県の南端、瀬戸内海沿岸に位置している市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%8E%89%E9%87%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111401356"}],"33205":[{"id":"33205:national:ea54973ca815","cityId":"33205","category":"文化・名所","text":"「応神山」は国指定の名勝です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2275"},{"id":"33205:national:ec892c2cfbc9","cityId":"33205","category":"地理・自然","text":"市の南には瀬戸内海が広がり、笠岡湾が入り込んでいます。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%AC%A0%E5%B2%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111113481"},{"id":"33205:national:e1bcae4558fd","cityId":"33205","category":"地域","text":"笠岡市は、岡山県の南西部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%AC%A0%E5%B2%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111113481"}],"33207":[{"id":"33207:national:0b05725f854c","cityId":"33207","category":"地域","text":"井原市は、岡山県の南西部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BA%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111025175"},{"id":"33207:national:328ef2358aa4","cityId":"33207","category":"地域","text":"井原市は岡山県の西南部に位置し、西は広島県に接する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%BA%95%E5%8E%9F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111025175"}],"33208":[{"id":"33208:national:140e417e86bb","cityId":"33208","category":"文化・名所","text":"市内には、岡山市西部にまたがる観光エリア・吉備路があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B7%8F%E7%A4%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111021644"},{"id":"33208:national:924ae152760d","cityId":"33208","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域を北西から南に高梁川が貫流しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B7%8F%E7%A4%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111021644"},{"id":"33208:national: